A-E | Dev2 | 5 | UI (all screens) | Spec and design approved
A-C | Dev3 | 1 | Exit + "Are you sure?" | Spec and design approved
B-D | Dev1 | 3 | Punch-out | DB schema ready
D-E | - | 0 | (waiting) | Punch-in reuses punch-out
B-C | - | 0 | (waiting) | Report reads the DB
E-F | Dev2 | 3 | Punch-in | Punch-out done, Dev2 free
D-F | Dev1 | 1 | Auto punch-out 5:30 PM | Punch-out done
C-F | Dev3 | 5 | Jobs Completed report | DB ready, Dev3 free
F-G | Dev1-3 | 3 | Integrate + test | All tasks done</panel_attributes>
